    "body": "@annevk I've reframed/retitled this issue. Recommending that servers follow the steps of CORS-preflight fetch would make CORS issues easier to debug and, thereby, would likely alleviate the troubles of users of CORS middleware libraries. More details at https://jub0bs.com/posts/2023-02-08-fearless-cors/#9-ease-troubleshooting-by-eschewing-shortcuts-during-preflight",
