    "body": "The tradeoff here is that you end up giving more information to potential attackers. What is best in any given situation is not something we can make a universal statement about I think.\r\n\r\nWith regards to the timing channel, that is mainly for non-preflight responses, though perhaps attackers can also learn something from the amount of time it takes to grant or deny access to a particular request.",
